{"code":"YL21","wikidata":"Q119009797","wikipedia":{"en":"Si Thepha MRT station","th":"สถานีศรีเทพา"},"summary":{"en":"Si Thepha station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Thepharak road in Samut Prakan Province and is a portmanteau of the name of Srinagarindra and Thepharak roads, which intersect adjacent to the station. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีศรีเทพา เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง ยกระดับเหนือถนนเทพารักษ์ในพื้นที่อำเภอเมืองสมุทรปราการ จังหวัดสมุทรปราการ"},"opened":"2023-06-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Si_Thepha_Station_01.jpg/960px-Si_Thepha_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Thepha_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Bangkok_Yellow_Line_Route_Map_at_Si_Thepha.jpg/960px-Bangkok_Yellow_Line_Route_Map_at_Si_Thepha.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bangkok_Yellow_Line_Route_Map_at_Si_Thepha.jpg","author":"Matthewmayer","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Si_Thepha_Station_02.jpg/960px-Si_Thepha_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Thepha_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Si_Thepha_Station_03.jpg/960px-Si_Thepha_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Thepha_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Si